OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRather cloudy with scattered
OL,6,Fshowers at first, turning to longer
OL,7,Fperiods of rain and hill snow in the
OL,8,Fsouth. Drier with some showers in the
OL,9,Fnorth. Fresh easterly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FIt will stay cloudy through
OL,12,Fthe evening and overnight with further
OL,13,Foutbreaks of mostly light rain towards
OL,14,FSkye, Lochaber and the Western Isles.
OL,15,FScattered showers further north.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FRather cloudy with some
OL,18,Fpatchy rain in the south. Clear spells
OL,19,Fand just a few showers in the north in
OL,20,Fthe morning will spread south to all
OL,21,Fparts later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
