OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FThursday and Friday chilly but often
OL,7,Fdry and bright, just a few showers in
OL,8,Fthe north and east. Mostly dry
OL,9,FSaturday but rain possible in west
OL,10,Flater. Overnight frosts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
